  "Skip login-mode chooser": "跳过登录模式选择器",
  "JSON array of model IDs or aliases (sonnet, opus, haiku). First entry is the picker default. Required for Vertex, Bedrock, and Foundry. For gateway: optional — when set, the picker shows exactly this list (use it to restrict cost or hide non-Claude routes); when unset, the picker shows whatever the gateway\\'s /v1/models endpoint returns. Entries may be plain strings or objects of the form {\"name\": \"<id>\", \"supports1m\": true} — set supports1m to offer a 1M-token-context picker variant for that model. Only set it for models your provider actually serves with the extended context window.": "模型 ID 或别名（sonnet、opus、haiku）的 JSON 数组。第一项是选择器默认值。Vertex、Bedrock 和 Foundry 必填。对于 gateway：可选；设置后，选择器只显示此列表（可用于限制成本或隐藏非 Claude 路由）；未设置时，选择器显示 gateway 的 /v1/models 端点返回的内容。条目可以是普通字符串，也可以是 {\"name\": \"<id>\", \"supports1m\": true} 形式的对象。设置 supports1m 会为该模型提供 100 万 token 上下文选择器变体。仅当你的提供商实际提供扩展上下文窗口时才设置。",
  "Only affects **tool calls** — inference and MCP traffic are covered by their own allowlists elsewhere.\\n\\nAccepts exact hostnames (`api.github.com`), wildcards (`*.corp.com` matches one subdomain level), and `*` to allow all.\\n\\nWildcards don't cross schemes. `*.corp.com` matches `docs.corp.com` but not `corp.com` itself — add both if you need the apex.\\n\\nIP literals and localhost always resolve regardless of this list; this is a public-egress filter, not a sandbox.\\n\\nHosts you add here also need to be open on your network firewall — see **Egress Requirements** for the full allowlist.": "仅影响 **工具调用**，推理和 MCP 流量由各自的允许列表控制。\\n\\n支持精确主机名（`api.github.com`）、通配符（`*.corp.com` 匹配一级子域）以及允许全部的 `*`。\\n\\n通配符不会跨层级匹配。`*.corp.com` 可匹配 `docs.corp.com`，但不会匹配 `corp.com` 本身；如果需要根域，请两者都添加。\\n\\n无论此列表如何设置，IP 字面量和 localhost 都始终可解析；这是公共出站过滤器，不是沙盒。\\n\\n你在这里添加的主机还需要在网络防火墙中放行；完整允许列表请参见 **出站访问要求**。",
